OL,3,AWhat we know so far after Krakow gun
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people were killed and
OL,7,Fmore than a dozen others injured when a
OL,8,Fgunman suspected to have ties to the
OL,9,Ffar-right opened fire in central
OL,10,FKrakow, the second largest city in
OL,11,FPoland.
OL,13,FThree bodies were found at his home
OL,14,Fwhen it was searched by police. Here is
OL,15,Feverything we know so far.
OL,17,FThe attack began shortly before 15:00
OL,18,Flocal time (14:00 GMT) in Krakow's Main
OL,19,FMarket Square, the bustling central
OL,20,Fpoint of the city which is popular with
OL,21,Ftourists.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
